    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26570" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεμ-πολάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sell to different buyers</i> or <i>sell in lots,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				512
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπορικὰ χρήματα δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					973
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί με . . διεμπολᾷ λόγοισι πρός
			σε;</span> what <i>bargain is</i> he <i>driving?</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				579
			</span></i>; of a mercenary marriage, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠθούμεθ᾽ ἔξω καὶ διεμπολώμεθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					583.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
